    {
      "id": "claim_c9d961880a6f4c1085cc6c23bfbafa1c",
      "statement": "TraceView requires a reachable ARDoCo REST backend at runtime: the backend address is browser state owned by ApiAddressContext, defaulting to https://rest.ardoco.de and hydrated from the localStorage key apiAddress, editable through the navbar's EditApiAddressModal; a candidate address is probed with GET /api/health through the proxy middleware and is persisted (and activated) only when the probe succeeds, so a failed probe leaves the previously active address unchanged.",
