    {
      "id": "claim_8ae550a9e3ee4cba8ea693c4f513fc60",
      "statement": "The /view/[id] page polls GET /api/get-result/{id} every 5 seconds for up to 240 seconds (4 minutes): status \"OK\" resolves the payload, \"ACCEPTED\" keeps polling, any other status throws an error carrying the backend's message verbatim, and exhausting the budget throws \"The result is still processing. Please try again later.\" — so a backend run lasting longer than 4 minutes fails in the UI even if it eventually completes.",
